Intuition
Reverse the string by swapping the characters from both ends and moving toward the center.

Approach
Use two pointers: one at the beginning and one at the end of the array. Swap their characters, then move the pointers inward until they meet.

Complexity
Time complexity: O(n)
Space complexity: O(1)
Code
class Solution {
    public void reverseString(char[] s) {
        int i = 0;
        int j = s.length - 1;

        while (i < j) {
            char temp = s[j];
            s[j] = s[i];
            s[i] = temp;
            i++;
            j--;
        }
    }
}
